WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.610
"It's movie night!" Dad said.

2
00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:09.746
"Yay!" Oliver cheered.

3
00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:13.415
"What will we watch?" Harry asked.

4
00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:17.594
"You kids can decide what to watch," Mom said.

5
00:00:17.595 --> 00:00:21.672
"Dad and I will make popcorn."

6
00:00:21.673 --> 00:00:24.633
Emmy turned on the TV.

7
00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:28.651
She flipped through the channel guide.

8
00:00:28.652 --> 00:00:34.181
Crack! Lightning lit up the sky.

9
00:00:34.182 --> 00:00:37.008
"Wow!" Oliver said.

10
00:00:37.009 --> 00:00:40.349
Suddenly the TV went dark.

11
00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:44.160
The room was dark too.

12
00:00:44.161 --> 00:00:46.787
"Hey!" Harry said.

13
00:00:46.788 --> 00:00:49.161
"What happened?"

14
00:00:49.162 --> 00:00:53.576
"It's a blackout." Emmy sighed.

15
00:00:53.577 --> 00:00:57.403
"Good-bye, movie night!"

16
00:00:57.404 --> 00:01:01.698
Mom and Dad came in with flashlights for everyone.

17
00:01:01.699 --> 00:01:06.229
"The power is out," Dad said.

18
00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:10.635
"We can still eat popcorn, right?" Oliver asked.

19
00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:13.655
Dad shook his head. "Nope.

20
00:01:13.656 --> 00:01:17.983
The power went out before the popcorn popped."

21
00:01:17.984 --> 00:01:21.334
"This stinks," Harry said.

22
00:01:21.335 --> 00:01:24.846
"We can still have fun," Mom said.

23
00:01:24.847 --> 00:01:27.119
She found candles.

24
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:33.104
Then she got board games from the closet.

25
00:01:33.105 --> 00:01:37.487
The family played a game by candlelight.

26
00:01:37.488 --> 00:01:40.911
"This is fun," Harry said.

27
00:01:40.912 --> 00:01:45.189
"Who wants to play hide-and-seek?" Oliver said.

28
00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:51.774
"We can use flashlights!" Emmy said.

29
00:01:51.775 --> 00:01:56.995
The family played hide-and-seek.

30
00:01:56.996 --> 00:02:04.482
Then the lights came back on.

31
00:02:04.483 --> 00:02:08.629
"The blackout is over!" Mom said.

32
00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:11.163
"Great!" Dad said.

33
00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:14.298
"Should we watch the movie now?"

34
00:02:14.299 --> 00:02:16.876
Emmy looked at Harry.

35
00:02:16.877 --> 00:02:19.590
Harry looked at Oliver.

36
00:02:19.591 --> 00:02:23.273
The three kids shook their heads.

37
00:02:23.274 --> 00:02:29.497
"Nope!" Emmy turned off the lights.

38
00:02:29.498 --> 00:02:36.884
"Let's have another blackout!"

